#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:5
#: 466f84bfa6c04eccbdb79f45310b0c4f
msgid "ST VL53L0X / VL53L1X Lidar"
msgstr "ST VL53L0X / VL53L1X 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:7
#: 468881b4c3a04fabae7fb4d7373109a0
msgid ""
"The `VL53L0X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-photonics-"
"solutions/vl53l0x.html>`__ & `VL53L1X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-"
"photonics-solutions/vl53l1x.html>`__ lidar are very small, affordable but "
"relatively short range (2m for VL53L0X & 4m for VL53L1X) time-of-flight "
"lidars"
msgstr ""
"`VL53L0X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-photonics-"
"solutions/vl53l0x.html>`__ 和 `VL53L1X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-"
"photonics-solutions/vl53l1x.html>`__ 激光雷达体积极小、价格实惠，但量程相对较短（VL53L0X 为 "
"2m，VL53L1X 为 4m），采用飞行时间测距原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:11
#: ac7aca3733eb42a68af1a844abd54131
msgid "*images courtesy of Pololu.com*"
msgstr "*图片来源：Pololu.com*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:16
#: 34dfb07d0b1f44f5b1b82d05e994cf58
msgid ""
"This sensor type is suitable for indoor use, however its range and precision"
" is significantly reduced in bright sunlight conditions and is not "
"recommended for outdoor use."
msgstr "该传感器适合室内使用，但在强阳光下量程和精度会大幅降低，不推荐用于室外场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:19
#: 72cb4a66a8ef4899a2255a3f39ee4617
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:21
#: 664868aa02ca4bdba3908c93530cc05c
msgid "`Pololu <https://www.pololu.com/product/2490>`__ (VL53L0X, 2m)"
msgstr "`Pololu <https://www.pololu.com/product/2490>`__ （VL53L0X，2m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:22
#: 60a782cc1b034eab83252e4fe46ed002
msgid "`Adafruit <https://www.adafruit.com/product/3317>`__ (VL53L0X, 2m)"
msgstr "`Adafruit <https://www.adafruit.com/product/3317>`__ （VL53L0X，2m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:23
#: 24eed4d24886404a96cfcb5452c30a7d
msgid "`Holybro <http://www.holybro.com/product/vl53l1x/>`__ (VL53L1X, 4m)"
msgstr "`Holybro <http://www.holybro.com/product/vl53l1x/>`__ （VL53L1X，4m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:26
#: e9330b6696a94d5582b7c5e6854052a1
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:28
#: 6413a5eddd014ac18f6916e7bd5ec21a
msgid ""
"Connect the VCC, GND, SDA and SCL lines of the lidar to the I2C port on the "
"autopilot as shown below for the first rangefinder."
msgstr "将激光雷达的 VCC、GND、SDA 和 SCL 线连接到飞控的 I2C 端口，作为第一个测距仪，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:32
#: f37d934a48724eaaaa695d313a7e3429
msgid ""
"Please set the rangefinder parameters as shown below (this can be done using"
" the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page):"
msgstr ""
"请按如下设置测距仪参数（可通过 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter "
"List** 页面进行设置）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:34
#: 1622c18bd32b42f28920c29f60f72482
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 16 (VL53L0X)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 16（VL53L0X）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:35
#: 9869e33b020942f19543f37e0a43e730
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 41 (I2C Address of lidar in decimal).  "
"*The sensor's default I2C address is 0x29 hexadecimal which is 41 in "
"decimal.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 41（十进制激光雷达 I2C 地址）。*传感器默认 I2C 地址为十六进制 "
"0x29，即十进制 41。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:36
#: fe27adaf56cd420b89764471942fa82c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:37
#: eb3a855466014180b3ed3c3270f09d49
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:38
#: cd07fa33ef2f46348b1883ff86c18225
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **1.2** for the VL53L0X, **3.6** for the "
"VL53L1X.  *This is the distance in meters that the rangefinder can reliably "
"read.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **1.2** （VL53L0X），**3.6** "
"（VL53L1X）。*这是测距仪可可靠读取的距离，单位为米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:39
#: a58b1f43c8544b92a56c0bb8bd94b8cb
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in meters from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更准确地说，是飞行器着陆时测距仪到地面的距离（单位：米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装位置。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:42
#: 90d811915e8c4ef59a6ea8ed973edd89
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:44
#: 2c4965a51e0040a3848ed8cb01a2d1e7
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\".(The value of "
"this image is not a real value.)"
msgstr ""
"传感器的读数可在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据界面的「Status」选项卡中查看。仔细查找「rangefinder1」。（图中数值并非真实值。）"
